# The sdist carries the package, the shipped models and the licence.
#
# tests/ is excluded deliberately: tests/refs holds 5.4 MB of reference data (one 4.8 MB
# grid), and the suite cannot run without it, so shipping the tests without the refs would
# ship files that fail on contact.  Clone the repository to run them -- CONTRIBUTING in the
# README says how.
prune tests
prune docs
prune extras
prune build
prune examples/__pycache__
global-exclude *.pyc .DS_Store
